# Order Lifecycle & Fulfillment Guide

This guide walks through submitting an order, streaming live status updates, and notifying baristas.

{% callout type="info" title="Real-time Webhook Updates" %}
When an order changes status from `pending` to `brewing` and `ready`, BrewCraft automatically emits an `order.status_updated` webhook event to your registered endpoint.
{% /callout %}

---

## Fulfillment Steps

{% steps %}
{% step title="1. Query Item Availability" %}
Before placing an order, ensure that your requested beans, syrups, and milks are currently in stock using the Catalog API.
{% /step %}

{% step title="2. Submit the Order Payload" %}
Send a `POST /orders` request specifying customer details, dining preference (`takeaway` or `dine-in`), and customization parameters:

{% tabs %}
{% tab name="cURL" %}
```bash
curl -X POST https://api.brewcraft.io/v1/orders \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "customerId": "cust_987654",
    "orderType": "takeaway",
    "items": [
      {
        "itemId": "item_flat_white",
        "name": "Velvet Flat White",
        "size": "medium",
        "milk": "oat",
        "quantity": 1,
        "unitPrice": 4.80
      }
    ]
  }'
```
{% /tab %}
{% tab name="JavaScript" %}
```javascript
const response = await fetch("https://api.brewcraft.io/v1/orders", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: {
    "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_TOKEN",
    "Content-Type": "application/json"
  },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    customerId: "cust_987654",
    orderType: "takeaway",
    items: [{
      itemId: "item_flat_white",
      name: "Velvet Flat White",
      size: "medium",
      milk: "oat",
      quantity: 1,
      unitPrice: 4.80
    }]
  })
});
const order = await response.json();
console.log("Created Order:", order.id);
```
{% /tab %}
{% /tabs %}
{% /step %}

{% step title="3. Live Kitchen Display" %}
The kitchen display updates instantly. Staff click "Begin Brewing" to transition status to `brewing`.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

---

## Interactive Endpoint Preview

Test this endpoint live in the interactive console below:

{% api-operation spec="orders" path="/orders" method="post" /%}

{% callout type="warning" title="Inventory Locks" %}
Orders in `pending` status reserve item inventory for up to 10 minutes. If payment is not confirmed within that window, the order expires automatically.
{% /callout %}
